<p>Khalid<br><strong>The Whale Warlord</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Age</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>37 - 45</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Occupation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Business owner / inheritance / senior professional (doctor, engineer, en=
