</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Location</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Riyadh, Saudi Arabia / Abu Dhabi, UAE / Kuwait</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Gaming Habits</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Plays 2=E2=80=934 hours daily, (1 hour during the day, and 2-3 often lat=
e at night)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Invested in 4X strategy games (Evony, Rise of Kingdoms, Revenge of Sulta=
ns)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Spends hundreds to thousands of USD monthly on power, speed-ups, VIP pac=
ks, and limited-time bundles, cosmetics and his alliance</p></li>
<li>
<p>Active leader or co-leader in top alliances; has a close group of co-spe=
nders</p></li>
<li>
<p>Talks to other whales and builds a community for decisions</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Motivations</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Wants to be the strongest and most feared player on the server</p></li>
<li>
<p>Prestige &amp; recognition in his community / alliance are as important =
as gameplay</p></li>
<li>
<p>Seeks exclusive content and bragging rights (skins, top heroes, VIP perk=
s)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys controlling the political balance of servers (alliances, migratio=
ns, wars)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Loves the power fantasy of instantly upgrading and winning key battles</=
p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pain Points</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Gets frustrated when spend doesn=E2=80=99t feel rewarding (poorly design=
ed bundles, weak value packs)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Hates unfair monetization that forces <em>even whales</em> into endless =
spending without clear payoff</p></li>
<li>
<p>Server resets or merges that wipe out his dominance feel like betrayal</=
p></li>
<li>
<p>In-game content moderation and lack of filtering bad words</p></li>
<li>
<p>Bad customer support or ignored bug reports break his trust</p></li>
<li>
<p>Poor localization makes him feel the game is =E2=80=9Cnot made for him=
=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Engagement Tactics</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Offer tiered VIP programs with clear, escalating rewards (Arabic-localiz=
ed)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Create exclusive events / tournaments for top spenders (leaderboards, et=
c.)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Give direct community recognition: spotlights (SM or other), alliance ba=
nners, skins in game and other</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide priority support / concierge service for whales</p></li>
<li>
<p>Limited-edition heroes, packs, or themed skins only for whales</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Messaging Strategy</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CRule Sparta, rule Olympus - your kingdom has no limits=E2=80=9D=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Position spending as unlocking legacy, not just speed-ups</p></li>
<li>
<p>Emphasize exclusivity: =E2=80=9COnly the chosen few can command=E2=80=9D=
</p></li>
<li>
<p>Showcase whales leading massive alliances in Arabic-language ads</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Reinforce prestige through titles, badges, leaderboards, VIP-only events=
</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
