2-82f35a6c7c8c">Motivations</span></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Wants to build a legendary pantheon of gods and heroes</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys self-expression through unique heroes and rare skins from events =
(showcase achievements)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Motivated by completionism (collecting full sets)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Likes strong narrative elements and immersive storytelling</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys experimenting with team synergies and hero builds</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pain Points</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Feels demotivated if hero systems are shallow or repetitive</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dislikes unfair gacha odds with no pity mechanics</p></li>
<li>
<p>Loses interest if lore is mistranslated or poorly localized</p></li>
<li>
<p>Gets frustrated if hero rewards are only accessible to whales</p></li>
<li>
<p>Feels sidelined when hero progression is overshadowed by timers and city=
 grind</p></li>
<li>
<p>Looking to play with other women in his guild or alliance</p></li>
<li>
<p>Likes social features and likes to talk to other in voice chat (to show =
how much he knows the game and how to play etc.)</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Engagement Tactics</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Launch with free starter gods/heroes localized in Arabic</p></li>
<li>
<p>Run seasonal hero events with clear timers for fairness</p></li>
<li>
<p>Introduce exclusive hero skins targeted at mid-spenders</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide deep hero guides and synergy UI in Arabic</p></li>
<li>
<p>Create lore-driven live-ops events to expand immersion</p></li>
<li>
<p>Provide social features like chat and voice chat mechanics</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Messaging Strategy</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CUnleash the heroes you command=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Hero spotlight ads with cinematic duels and mythic backstories</p></li>
<li>
<p>Emphasize individuality: =E2=80=9CYour pantheon, your story=E2=80=9D</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Highlight =E2=80=98teamwork=E2=80=99 or =E2=80=98friends=E2=80=99</p></l=
i>
<li>
