<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Name</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ahmad<br><strong>The Casual Conqueror</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Age</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>19</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Occupation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>University Student</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Location</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Amman, Jordan or Cairo, Egypt</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Gaming Habits</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Plays in short bursts (10=E2=80=9320 minutes) usually during commutes, c=
lass breaks, or late nights (spends a lot of time to grind as well - 8 hour=
s).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Mostly free-to-play; may occasionally spend $1=E2=80=935 on starter pack=
s if rewards look impactful.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Will grind daily quests and do login missions if they feel achievable. W=
ill have other accounts as well for farming and resources.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Joins special event grinds (e.g., double-resource weekends, limited hero=
 unlocks) if rewards feel immediate.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Motivations</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Wants to feel part of epic battles without needing to invest money.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>Likes instant progression spikes and brag-worthy milestones.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Seeks fun, social validation (=E2=80=9Clook at my army/heroes=E2=80=9D m=
oments) from quick bursts of effort.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys grind loops only if they give visible short-term results (troops,=
 skins, hero fragments).</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pain Points</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Quits if grinding feels endless without meaningful payoff.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Frustrated by progression walls appearing too early (e.g., timers &gt;12=
 hrs in first week).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Leaves if grind is too tied to spending or whales always outpace him.</p=
></li>
<li>
<p>Gets discouraged if rewards feel trivial compared to time invested.</p><=
/li>
<li>
<p>No special bundles or customized offers for his payment range.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Engagement Tactics</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Provide daily grind loops with rewards capped at ~15 minutes.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Create =E2=80=9Cevent grinds=E2=80=9D with themed goals (e.g., collect X=
 resources during Eid for a special hero skin).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Design streak systems (3-day or 7-day grinds) with clear rewards.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p>Keep grind layered into casual play: auto-gather, quick troop training, =
easy battles.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Give him =E2=80=9Cjust enough=E2=80=9D grind to stay hooked without burn=
ing out.</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Messaging Strategy</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CEpic wars in your pocket - progress every day, even in minutes.=
=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Ads showing quick grind and instant big reward (e.g., collect for 3 minu=
tes, unlock Zeus fragment).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Stress low effort, high payoff: =E2=80=9CPlay a little, win a lot.=E2=80=
=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Use event-based ads that make grind look fun and time-limited (Ramadan g=
rind events, double loot weekends).</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
