<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 187.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 571.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Name</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Layla<br><strong>The Social Strategist</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Age</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>27</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Occupation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Social Media Manager / Young Professional</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Location</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Lebanon, Syria or Levant</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Gaming Habits</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Plays 2 hours daily, mostly evenings with friends</p></li>
<li>
<p>Prioritizes games with strong guild/alliance systems (with whales) and s=
ocial play</p></li>
<li>
<p>Active on Discord, WhatsApp, and Instagram for game-related chat</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Spends lightly ($10=E2=80=9320/month) on cosmetics, guild-related events=
, and shared bundles</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys watching alliance videos and sharing progress on social media</p>=
</li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Motivations</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Wants to bond with friends through guilds and teamwork</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys being a strategic supporter or co-leader</p></li>
<li>
<p>Values inclusivity and recognition within alliances</p></li>
<li>
<p>Finds satisfaction in community-driven achievements</p></li>
<li>
<p>Enjoys collecting cosmetics and identity-driven content</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pain Points</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Leaves games with toxic chat or unfriendly communities</p></li>
<li>
<p>Feels excluded if rewards go only to leaders or whales</p></li>
<li>
<p>Gets discouraged by weak social tools (chat limitations, bad translation=
s)</p></li>
<li>
<p>Quits if female heroes/skins are underrepresented</p></li>
<li>
<p>Finds it demotivating if alliances cannot organize effectively</p></li>
<li>
<p>Need to find other women playing like them</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Engagement Tactics</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>Friend-invite systems with shared rewards</p></li>
<li>
<p>Inclusive cosmetic skins and female hero spotlights in Arabic</p></li>
<li>
<p>Guild growth events with recognition for supportive roles</p></li>
<li>
<p>Highlight alliance achievements in community posts</p></li>
<li>
<p>Invest in Arabic-friendly guild chat features (stickers, voice notes)</p=
></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Messaging Strategy</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<ul>
<li>
<p>=E2=80=9CBuild legends with your friends=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Use that a woman is strong in the game and winning over them</p></li>
<li>
<p>Ads showcasing alliances fighting together, not just solo glory</p></li>
<li>
<p>Partner with female Arab influencers to highlight inclusivity</p></li>
<li>
<p>Push teamwork and shared progress: =E2=80=9CYour team, your myth, your s=
tory=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li>
<p>Highlight guild pride and recognition systems in Arabic</p></li>
</ul></td>
</tr>
